          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "GoKwik Launches AI-Powered Kwik Ship to Cut Failed E-Commerce Deliveries by 20% Across India",
            "articleSection": "Daily Utility",
            "abstract": "GoKwik has launched Kwik Ship, an AI-powered logistics platform designed to reduce failed deliveries by up to 20% for Indian e-commerce brands. The system uses AI-powered calls and automated WhatsApp notifications to keep customers informed and provides more accurate delivery time estimates at checkout. The platform directly addresses one of Indian e-commerce's most persistent pain points — high return-to-origin rates caused by failed deliveries.",
            "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/tech/startups/gokwik-launches-ai-powered-kwik-ship-for-faster-ecommerce-deliveries-in-india/articleshow/130961375.cms",
            "publisher": {
